{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "過了一天，感覺瀨名比昨天對我更沒有防備了。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要有這個燒賣的皮，不管包什麼都能變成一道點心的感覺呢……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1469", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "順帶一提，今天的特別課程是料理實習，主題是做燒賣。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「下次便宜的時候買來試看看好了。你不覺得點心風的便當很棒嗎？」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1470", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要裡面不是放醃蘿蔔我就覺得不錯。」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要再提了啦！醃蘿蔔早就吃完了！」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1471", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吶吶，拜託了我們這組這樣就好不要放豌豆……」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "sc0024", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係的，今天是要做道地風，而且我們組根本沒拿到那個。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1472", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該說沒有才是正確的……啊啊～在那邊吃到的時候完全沒有放真是太好了。」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "sn0168", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，沒有放的話色彩上確實有點寂寞。最初吃的時候還感覺很無趣呢。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1473", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理也常常去啊？」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "sn0169", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……以前啦，以前。突然被媽媽帶走，等我發現的時候就上飛機了。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1474", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……大小姐們聊出國經驗聊得那麼熱絡……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "sc0025", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再順帶一提，分組早已經固定為最初的這些成員了。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這三人再加上我，手法不熟練地包著燒賣……", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，結束。那就立刻來蒸吧。」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1475", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔！」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "sc0026", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，那邊的混帳傢伙。為什麼拿兩個蒸籠來？還有地瓜。」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "sn0170", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，這是瀨名叫我拿來的。」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是為了加一道菜用的啦。地瓜正值產季，一起蒸起來吃吧。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1476", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔，大小姐果然很有風雅呢！」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "sc0027", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，為什麼愛理總是這麼正經啊。」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "sn0171", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然啦，只做一道就結束太不像話了……」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1477", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，就由我們來負責蒸吧。只讓愛理一個人表現就太遜了。」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "sn0172", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "sc0028", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她們兩人鬥志高昂地開始擺放蒸籠──然後瀨名笑著瞄了我一眼。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……其實啊。」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1478", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她靠到我身邊小聲說。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是因為我最喜歡吃蒸的東西了。」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1479", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、這樣啊……」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我覺得一陣酥麻。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要保密喔。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1480", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，此時拉開距離的瀨名露出笑容，完全沒有注意到自己的行為有多麼曖昧……", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，那邊交給紗凪她們，我們就負責處理這邊的吧！」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1481", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、嗯，好，開始動手吧。」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還發生了這樣的事。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……吶，這跟昨天看的是相同的漫畫吧？畫風完全不同啊……」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1482", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這一點就只能當成常識接受了。長期連載的話，好像無論如何都會出現這種狀況。」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「漫畫也有各種知識啊……對了瓜生。」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1483", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那個，不好意思打擾你們，瓜生君可以過來一下嗎？」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "jc0033", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……等我一下喔瀨名。」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當我與瀨名在聊漫畫單行本的時候，班上同學突然來搭話。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，剛才我擦了黑板，但是今天的值日生兩個都是女孩子，所以上面……」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "jc0034", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，嗯，我知道了，我幫妳們擦吧。畢竟踩椅子上去也不方便。」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝你～」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "jc0035", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連一開始對男生的視線毫無防備的結女學生們，現在也恰到好處地在意起來了。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這樣一來男生們就不用窮緊張，對我個人來說很感激這樣的變化。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我接過板擦，正要去擦黑板上方的部分時──", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……欸？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等等等、瀨名！妳要去哪裡！？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我連忙擦乾淨黑板，追在瀨名身後來到走廊。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……職員室。去問明天班會的事。冷靜想想，現在不是看漫畫的時候了。」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1485", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為我在聊到一半的時候去幫其他女生，所以瀨名鬧彆扭了……？", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等一下等一下，那樣的話我也去。」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你去擦黑板啦。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1486", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「黑板已經擦好了。」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就去幫其他女生的忙啊。」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1487", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉。明明借漫畫給瀨名才是我第一個答應要幫的。」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1488", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「去職員室吧？回來後再聊漫畫的後續吧。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1489", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我還有很多不懂的地方喔。比如橫跨兩頁的格子要怎麼看之類的。」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1490", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她終於點頭，然後語速有點快地對我說。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那種的話……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還有！去職員室確認完後，當然是要開始工作了。不會讓你說擦黑板很忙所以沒辦法幫忙那種話喔！」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1491", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就～說～了～黑板已經擦好了啦～」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和她邊走邊開玩笑，我的內心不禁雀躍了起來。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──那個瀨名，居然也會做這種像吃醋的行為啊。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，時間來到放學。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拖得有點晚了呢。」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉。今天工作的時候我聊太多廢話了。」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1492", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，就算是班級幹部的工作，能邊聊天邊開心地做是最好的。」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1493", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對吧，瓜生。」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1494", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你願意的話，要不要來我家一下？我覺得還聊不夠呢。」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1495", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……她這樣約我。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然，我不會拒絕。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尤其是她如此率直地邀約，就更不會了……", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然後怎麼了？結果氣喘是什麼時候治好的？」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1496", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到了她家坐下後，瀨名就開始很感興趣地問我以前的事情。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想盡可能知道我的事情。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "清晰地感受到她的心意……我很高興，但也有點難受。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生。」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1497", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、唔、嗯，抱歉抱歉。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛……其實等我注意到的時候就已經不再發作了。不過後遺症是到現在還對灰塵很敏感。」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊……所以瓜生才會莫名對氣氛很敏感啊。」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1498", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，最近對瀨名以外的人都不怎麼在意了……", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使如此，只有對她還是會想回答她的任何提問，有了喜歡的女孩後，男生變得真是滑稽呢。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，對家人也那麼顧慮……我覺得櫻乃應該完全不在意的。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1499", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼說來，瓜生你的雙親一直沒有回家嗎？」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1500", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，從以前就是這種感覺……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總之，我繼續回答她的問題。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為我感覺得出來她希望我這麼做。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這段時間，你一直都是跟櫻乃兩個人分擔家事的吧？然後──」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1501", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "越是回答她，她就越積極地繼續拋出問題。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯──」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "簡直就像……", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "對找到的某個閃閃發光的東西著迷一般。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊！已經這麼晚了！」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1502", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聊了好一會後，瀨名突然注意到時間。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知不覺中，窗外的天色已經暗了。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……對了瀨名，妳是不是要打工？」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，就算現在出門也快遲到了……！欸～啊～欸……」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1503", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是備用鑰匙！抱歉麻煩你鎖門了！那我走了，明天見喔……！」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 365, "voice": "ar1504", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她相當焦急，把鑰匙放在我面前後就像風一樣衝出家門了。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只剩我一個人留在瀨名家裡。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃……嗯。」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道她的個性正經，絕對不會允許自己遲到。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過她一定完全沒有思考過現在的狀況吧。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身為女孩子的她，讓男生的我一個人留在家裡的危險性。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔。」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "啊啊，可惡。我畢竟是男人啊。無論如何就是會湧出邪念。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隨隨便便就能翻找她私人物品的這個狀況──", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唉。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不要想、不要想。我提醒自己，然後離開瀨名的家。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "鎖上家門的鑰匙，現在在我的口袋中。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『新吾同學好像哥哥一樣呢！』", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "ag0461", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想起安潔的話。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她說的一點也沒錯，可是……", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……當『哥哥』，實在很辛苦啊。」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
